Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:51.78,Hdr,,0,0,0,,October 29, 2017 - Tenno Sho (Autumn)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.80,0:00:03.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,Pouring rain, a heavy-ground Tenno Sho - and here's Kitasan Black
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.90,0:00:06.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,Despite a slow start, he's come up along the rail
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.80,0:00:09.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,The ultimate test of strength - Kitasan Black leads
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.70,0:00:12.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,Chasing the spring-autumn double, Kitasan Black is in front
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.50,0:00:16.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,Outside him, Grand Prix winner Satono Crown is closing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.10,0:00:18.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,Rainbow Line in third behind them
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.20,0:00:22.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,Kitasan Black leads, proudly down the centre of the track
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.50,0:00:25.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,Satono Crown closing - Rainbow Line third
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.60,0:00:29.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,Up the hill, not far to go - Kitasan Black leads
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.20,0:00:32.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,Satono Crown closing on the inside - Satono Crown closing!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.50,0:00:35.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,But Kitasan Black won't yield - Kitasan Black leads
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.70,0:00:38.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,Kitasan Black shrugged off that slow start
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.90,0:00:40.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,And wins it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.60,0:00:44.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,Satono Crown second
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:47.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,A commanding Kitasan Black takes the spring and autumn Tenno Sho
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.50,0:00:50.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,He's proven he's the best horse in training!